# scenario: resume-admitted
# doc: resume-admitted.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude resume-admitted.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: launch 1 reports session session-1 and exits 1 with no result; launch 2 (the resume of session-1) exits 0 with a result
# given: failure returns resume
event initialize
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event start
work resume 0
event success
event finalize
err none
exit 0
